### contrat-service — collection d'exemples (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
### Base
@host = http://localhost:8091
@base = {{host}}/api/v1

### JWT de test (DIRECTEUR d'une école) — généré avec le secret partagé.
### Régénérer via :
### node -e "console.log(require('jsonwebtoken').sign({userId:'11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111',schoolId:'aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa',roleCode:'DIRECTEUR'},'educa_access_secret_2026',{expiresIn:'2h'}))"
@jwt = REMPLACER_PAR_UN_JWT

### JWT admin EDUCA (schoolId = tenant système)
@jwtEduca = REMPLACER_PAR_UN_JWT_EDUCA

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Santé
GET {{host}}/health

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Référentiel des types de contrat
GET {{base}}/contract-types
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Créer un contrat PERSONNEL (schoolId du body est IGNORÉ)
# @name createPersonnel
POST {{base}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contractTypeId": "REMPLACER_PAR_UN_ID_CDI",
  "title": "Contrat enseignant — Jean Baptiste",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "amount": "35000.00",
  "currency": "HTG",
  "schoolId": "CE-CHAMP-SERA-IGNORE"
}

### Capturer l'id créé
@contractId = {{createPersonnel.response.body.data.id}}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Ajouter une partie (employé)
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/parties
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partyType": "PERSON",
  "roleInContract": "EMPLOYE",
  "fullName": "Jean Baptiste",
  "email": "jean.baptiste@example.com"
}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Uploader un document PDF (multipart)
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

ORIGINAL
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document"; filename="contrat.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./data/sample.pdf
------boundary--

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Transitions DRAFT → ACTIVE
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStatus": "PENDING_APPROVAL" }

###
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStatus": "APPROVED" }

###
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStatus": "PENDING_SIGNATURE" }

###
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStatus": "ACTIVE", "reason": "Signé par les deux parties" }

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Transition INTERDITE → 409 (DRAFT direct vers ACTIVE sur un nouveau contrat)
POST {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStatus": "DRAFT" }

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Détail du contrat
GET {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 8. Historique (statuts + audit)
GET {{base}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Liste paginée + filtres
GET {{base}}/contracts?page=1&limit=20&status=ACTIVE&search=enseignant
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Créer un contrat ETABLISSEMENT (admin EDUCA requis)
POST {{base}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtEduca}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contractTypeId": "REMPLACER_PAR_UN_ID_ABONNEMENT",
  "title": "Abonnement SaaS — École Sainte-Marie",
  "subjectSchoolId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "amount": "120000.00",
  "renewalMode": "AUTO"
}

### 11. Lister les contrats d'une école précise
GET {{base}}/contracts?scope=ETABLISSEMENT&subjectSchoolId=bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtEduca}}
